      "writtenOn": "2024-02-23T22:32:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t going to do what you want. [This function](https://developer.android.com/ndk/reference/group/image-decoder#aimagedecoderheaderinfo_getheight) returns the *encoded* size of the image. If this loop has called `AImageDecoder_setTargetSize` to use a larger size, then the allocated memory for the pixels won\u0027t be big enough, and `AImageDecoder_decodeImage` will write to memory outside the pixels.",
      "revId": "ad846f699abb124307924eab752c832403669d17",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    }
